{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "id": "02-incomplete-indexer-lying-witness",
  "title": "Incomplete indexer: a source file has no scip_document and a lying reachability witness",
  "rule_pack": "rules-static-v1",
  "provenance": {
    "kind": "synthetic",
    "source": "hand-authored adversarial static case",
    "seeded_fault": "lying-completeness-witness"
  },
  "context": {
    "index": "694d1ff6509c1d18098156da8741fbb1f8424814ffaf22e1d1850125c48564f2"
  },
  "review_notes": [
    "static_source_file lists internal/audit/hooks.go but scip_document does not; scip_documents_closed is present, so static_file_unindexed derives for that path.",
    "The positive capability is unaffected: every hop of GetJob -> Fetch -> Repo#Get is indexed.",
    "SEEDED FAULT: the exporter emitted static_reachability_closed although a file is unindexed. The gap claim then derives from the witness; support_leaves intersects forbidden_leaves, which is the signature of a lying witness."
  ],
